import DerivedAlgGeo.CategoryTheory.Triangulated.Basic

/-!
# A tier table kept in the module docstring

A Markdown table row is the line; splitting it makes two malformed rows, so it
is unbreakable in the same way an `import` is.

| Tier | Module | What it supplies |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Unbounded | `Tensor/Unbounded.lean` | the K-flat tensor bifunctor on complexes of module sheaves, **constructed** from a supplied resolution |
| Relative | `Tensor/Relative.lean` | `HasMonoidalDerivedPullback`, compatibility with derived pullback along a morphism of schemes |
-/

theorem tiered : True := trivial
